WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:03.183
Why is trading used books so hard?

2
00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:06.369
面交怕詐騙 寄送嫌麻煩
Meeting up feels risky. Shipping is a hassle.

3
00:00:06.900 --> 00:00:08.395
超過一半的人
More than half of respondents

4
00:00:08.395 --> 00:00:12.132
想要 24 小時自助存取的實體書櫃
want a physical locker with 24/7 self-service access.

5
00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:19.493
SaveMyBook — a used-book marketplace built around smart lockers

6
00:00:21.300 --> 00:00:25.900
書櫃只用一片 ESP32 就能控制四扇櫃門
A single ESP32 controls all four locker doors

7
00:00:25.900 --> 00:00:28.079
並與伺服器即時同步
and stays in sync with the server in real time.

8
00:00:30.300 --> 00:00:31.645
存書只要四步
Storing a book takes just four steps.

9
00:00:31.645 --> 00:00:35.679
第一 用 App 掃描書櫃上的 QR Code
First, scan the locker's QR code with the app.

10
00:00:36.800 --> 00:00:39.312
第二 輸入螢幕上的數字
Second, enter the number shown on the screen,

11
00:00:39.312 --> 00:00:41.573
並確認你就在書櫃旁
confirming you're right at the locker.

12
00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:45.143
第三 指定櫃門自動開啟
Third, the assigned door unlocks automatically.

13
00:00:45.143 --> 00:00:47.258
30 秒內放入書籍
Place your book inside within 30 seconds.

14
00:00:48.400 --> 00:00:51.109
最後 關上櫃門就完成存書
Finally, close the door and you're done.

15
00:00:51.109 --> 00:00:53.572
買家也會同步收到通知
The buyer is notified instantly.

16
00:00:55.800 --> 00:00:59.660
從上架到售後 七項 AI 功能全程協助
Seven AI features help from listing to after-sales.

17
00:01:02.300 --> 00:01:05.257
拍張照片 AI 就能判斷書況
Snap a photo, and AI assesses the book's condition,

18
00:01:05.257 --> 00:01:08.215
並查詢書目、建議合理售價
looks up its details, and suggests a fair price.

19
00:01:10.600 --> 00:01:13.495
規則檢查加上 AI 影像審核
Rule-based checks plus AI image review

20
00:01:13.495 --> 00:01:15.425
雙層把關上架品質
keep every listing up to standard.

21
00:01:17.900 --> 00:01:22.532
書籍資料不完整？系統會自動幫你補齊
Missing book details? The system fills them in for you.

22
00:01:23.600 --> 00:01:27.286
系統會根據收藏與瀏覽紀錄推薦好書
Picks based on your favorites and browsing history —

23
00:01:27.286 --> 00:01:29.128
每一本都附上理由
each with a reason why.

24
00:01:31.800 --> 00:01:33.901
只要說出需求和預算
Just describe what you need and your budget,

25
00:01:33.901 --> 00:01:36.469
AI 書籍顧問就幫你挑書
and the AI book advisor picks for you.

26
00:01:38.600 --> 00:01:41.788
有問題？AI 客服立即回覆
Questions? The AI assistant answers instantly.

27
00:01:41.788 --> 00:01:44.445
複雜狀況一鍵轉接真人
Complex issues go to a person in one tap.

28
00:01:45.200 --> 00:01:48.738
發生爭議時 AI 會比對照片與說明
In a dispute, AI compares photos and descriptions,

29
00:01:48.738 --> 00:01:51.333
整理證據協助管理員裁決
organizing evidence to help admins decide.

30
00:01:53.000 --> 00:01:56.592
AI 用量設有上限 使用前須經同意
AI usage is capped and requires consent,

31
00:01:56.592 --> 00:01:59.466
對話紀錄 90 天後自動刪除
and chat logs are deleted after 90 days.

32
00:02:00.400 --> 00:02:02.509
款項先由平台暫管
Payments are held by the platform

33
00:02:02.509 --> 00:02:05.673
取書 24 小時後才撥給賣家
and released to the seller 24 hours after pickup.

34
00:02:07.000 --> 00:02:08.831
Every payment is verified once more,

35
00:02:08.831 --> 00:02:11.579
可以用交易密碼或生物辨識
by transaction PIN or biometrics.

36
00:02:14.800 --> 00:02:17.913
偵測到私下交易或詐騙話術時
When off-platform deals or scam tactics are detected,

37
00:02:17.913 --> 00:02:20.069
系統會即時提醒雙方
both sides are warned right away.

38
00:02:22.000 --> 00:02:25.829
從 Flutter App、Node.js 後端
From the Flutter app and Node.js backend

39
00:02:25.829 --> 00:02:29.111
到 ESP32 智慧書櫃 一套系統完整串起
to the ESP32 smart locker — one connected system.

40
00:02:31.000 --> 00:02:35.759
296 個 API、超過 4,000 項測試全數通過
296 APIs and 4,000+ tests, all passing,

41
00:02:35.759 --> 00:02:37.489
支援五種介面語言
in five interface languages.

42
00:02:38.800 --> 00:02:40.836
服務費規劃只收一成
A planned service fee of just 10% —

43
00:02:40.836 --> 00:02:44.682
遠低於委託寄賣的三成五 賣家拿得更多
far below consignment's 35%, so sellers keep more.

44
00:02:47.300 --> 00:02:50.200
Let idle books circulate again.

45
00:02:51.400 --> 00:02:52.860
SaveMyBook
